# experiment: tip-p12-thread-budget — Default(CPU spin 15)·IO(sleep 100, 한도 64)·IO.limitedParallelism(10)(sleep 30)·IO.limitedParallelism(100)(sleep 150) 를 따로/동시에 포화시킬 때 1초 시점 platform thread 총량과 DefaultDispatcher-worker 수. 상한(산술) 15+64+10+100=189 와 비교. 작업은 2초씩, 케이스마다 새 JVM, 3회
# java -version:
#   openjdk version "26.0.2.1" 2026-08-18
#   OpenJDK Runtime Environment (build 26.0.2.1+1-7)
#   OpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM (build 26.0.2.1+1-7, mixed mode, sharing)
# kotlinc -version: info: kotlinc-jvm 2.3.20 (JRE 26.0.2.1+1-7)  ("/Applications/IntelliJ IDEA.app/Contents/plugins/Kotlin/kotlinc/bin/kotlinc" -version 실출력)
# deps: kotlinx-coroutines-core-jvm 1.10.2
# machine: Apple M5 Pro (arm64), hw.ncpu=15
# date: 2026-10-08 10:39:36 KST
